1
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:05,500
是的 我还病着呢
Yes, I am still sick.

2
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:07,100
是的 我周六还得上班
Yes, I'm going to work on a Saturday.

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:09,445
这不是酒 这是感冒药
No, this is not wine. It is DayQuil.

4
00:00:09,445 --> 00:00:11,340
掺了点昨晚的酒
With a little bit of last night's wine.

5
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:12,940
我那蠢弟弟在墨西哥
My stupid brother caught a cold

6
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:14,740
度蜜月时竟然感冒了
in Mexico on his honeymoon,

7
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:16,500
结果还传染了全家人
and it's made its way through the family.

8
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:17,840
我从不生病
I never get sick.

9
00:00:17,851 --> 00:00:19,580
肯定是在沙滩上我的袜子湿了
I-I must've caught a chill on the beach

10
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:20,720
所以着了凉
when my socks got wet.

11
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:23,200
我的脚踝疼得很
My ankles burn.

12
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,020
坐飞机回家时 我的耳朵也开始疼了
It went to my ears on our flight home.

13
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:28,660
我可能是呻吟了几声
I may have moaned a bit.

14
00:00:28,934 --> 00:00:30,760
被一个大哭的婴儿投诉说声音太大
A crying baby complained about me.

15
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:32,600
小卡从墨西哥给我带回了这玩意
Cam brought me this from Mexico,

16
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:34,460
还害我得了支气管炎 病了两周
along with two weeks of bronchitis.

17
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,480
真不知道哪个更糟糕
I don't know which is worse.

18
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,260
我被传染了眩晕症
It gave me the vertigo.

19
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:40,640
一穿高跟鞋就晕
I was too dizzy for high heels.

20
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:42,200
害我只能穿平底鞋
I had to wear flats.

21
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:44,840
真不知道别人穿着那种鞋是怎么走路的
I don't know how people can walk in those things.

22
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:46,800
我错过了烹饪营前两天的课程
I missed the first two days of culinary camp,

23
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:49,480
完全跟不上做浓缩醋和蛋白饼的进度
so I was hopelessly behind on all reductions and meringues.

24
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:51,040
试想他们给我起的绰号
You can imagine the nicknames.

25
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:53,920
我觉得"逗逼"这名字挺伤人的
I thought "amuse-douche" was particularly cruel.

26
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:55,680
我连着吐了三天
I threw up for three straight days.

27
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:58,020
真不知道模特们是怎么做到的
I don't know how models do it.

28
00:00:58,089 --> 00:01:00,340
祝你今天会议成功 亲爱的
Knock 'em dead at the big meeting today, honey.

29
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:00,760
来个幸运之吻不
Kiss for good luck?

30
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:02,000
不行 我不能害你也生病
Oh, no! I'm not getting you sick.

31
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:03,140
这场感冒到我为止
This cold stops with me.

32
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:05,160
不然我昨晚为什么要跟卢克换床睡
Why do you think I swapped beds with Luke last night?

33
00:01:05,240 --> 00:01:05,720
你换了吗
You did?

34
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:07,380
非常感谢你的背部按摩
Appreciate the back rub.

35
00:01:07,380 --> 00:01:09,907
但我可不太喜欢被叫"自以为是小姐"
Not sure I love being called "Miss Thang."

36
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:10,320
不是吧
No!

37
00:01:22,980 --> 00:01:23,780
大家好
Hey, everybody.

38
00:01:24,620 --> 00:01:24,980
老爸
Hey, dad --

39
00:01:24,980 --> 00:01:27,189
不是吧
Noooo.

40
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:29,340
米奇和小卡当时找不到婚礼摄像师
Mitch and Cam were stuck for a wedding videographer,

41
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:31,720
我就帮他们联系了一个拍专题广告的朋友
so I hooked them up with a friend who shoots infomercials.

42
00:01:32,020 --> 00:01:33,240
算是他欠我的吧
He kind of owed me.

43
00:01:33,580 --> 00:01:35,860
我明白你为什么称之为奇迹手套了
I can see why you call them "Miracle gloves."

44
00:01:36,340 --> 00:01:37,900
我的头完全不疼了
My headache's completely gone.

45
00:01:39,020 --> 00:01:40,300
他把录像给了我
He dropped off the video

46
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:41,440
今晚我们会在杰和歌洛莉亚家
for the big viewing party

47
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:44,120
开观影派对 所以我想提前看看
at Jay and Gloria's tonight, and I decided to preview it.

48
00:01:44,460 --> 00:01:45,040
怎么了
What's wrong?

49
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:45,640
你看
Watch.

50
00:01:45,780 --> 00:01:46,560
我就长话短说吧
I'm gonna keep it short

51
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:48,449
因为再过十分钟就要开球了
'cause I got a tee-time in 10 minutes.

52
00:01:48,449 --> 00:01:49,760
天哪
Oh, God.

53
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,000
说来也巧
Kind of funny.

54
00:01:50,380 --> 00:01:52,900
我父亲死于25年前的今天
My dad died 25 years ago today.

55
00:01:52,900 --> 00:01:54,680
直接喷在蛋糕上了
Ew! Right on the cake.

56
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:55,500
我知道 你接着看
I know. Keep watching.

57
00:01:55,500 --> 00:01:57,078
很高兴能用这一快乐时刻
...nice to replace that sad memory

58
00:01:57,078 --> 00:01:59,011
代替那段伤心的记忆
with this happy one.

59
00:01:59,440 --> 00:02:01,380
别告诉我米奇舅舅还喝了
Don't tell me uncle Mitch drinks it.

60
00:02:01,420 --> 00:02:02,820
他当然喝了 一滴不剩
Of course he does -- every drop.

61
00:02:02,820 --> 00:02:06,300
愿你的第一次婚姻和我的第二次一样幸福
May your first marriage be as goods my second.

62
00:02:06,300 --> 00:02:07,260
敬新郎们
To the grooms.

63
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:09,260
等等 我收回
Wait a minute. I take that back.

64
00:02:10,040 --> 00:02:10,840
敬我的儿子们
To my sons.

65
00:02:11,580 --> 00:02:13,040
你为什么就不能遮住嘴呢
Why didn't you just cover your mouth?

66
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,020
最后遮住了
Oh, I finally did.

67
00:02:21,260 --> 00:02:22,740
你知道这意味着什么吗
You know what this means?

68
00:02:22,740 --> 00:02:24,020
我才是第一个生病的人
I'm patient zero.

69
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:25,300
我还以为我是过敏
What I thought were allergies

70
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:26,920
却导致了全家人挨个病倒了
started the cold that brought the whole family down!

71
00:02:27,580 --> 00:02:28,780
不能让任何人知道这件事
No one can ever know about this --

72
00:02:28,780 --> 00:02:30,040
尤其是发生约塞米蒂国家公园那件事之后
Not after what happened in Yosemite.

73
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:31,760
粉眼末日
The pink-eye apocalypse.

74
00:02:34,370 --> 00:02:35,940
-有只白眉山雀 -在哪儿
- A mountain chickadee! - Where?

75
00:02:35,940 --> 00:02:37,560
每个人轮流看一眼
Take a look and send it down the line.

76
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,335
在哪儿 你在哪儿看到的 我想看看
Where? Where do you see it? I want to see.

77
00:02:39,335 --> 00:02:40,840
就在那儿 在那儿 那儿呢
Oh, right there! Right there! Right there!

78
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:42,220
我整整花了一年才赢回
It took me a whole year to earn back

79
00:02:42,220 --> 00:02:43,920
家人的尊重和崇拜
the respect and admiration of my family.

80
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:44,920
这个嘛
Well...

81
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,740
但还有六小时就要放映了
But it's six hours to the screening,

82
00:02:46,740 --> 00:02:48,400
我得把打喷嚏的画面都剪掉
and I have to edit out all those sneezes

83
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:49,620
还不能毁了杰的演讲
without ruining Jay's speech.

84
00:02:49,740 --> 00:02:50,980
所以得用上特效
That means special effects,

85
00:02:50,980 --> 00:02:52,780
还得盖上绿屏
that means overlapping green screen.

86
00:02:52,820 --> 00:02:54,240
我在说什么呢 那是不可能的啊
What am I saying?! It's impossible!

87
00:02:55,420 --> 00:02:56,360
很抱歉 老爸
I'm sorry, dad.

88
00:02:57,220 --> 00:02:57,860
不 你做得对
No, you're right.

89
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:00,780
不能再像个小姑娘一样发牢骚了
It's time to stop whining like a little girl

90
00:03:00,780 --> 00:03:01,600
要爷们儿点
and man up!

91
00:03:02,060 --> 00:03:03,560
穿上紧身衣
Let's put on our unitards!

92
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:08,760
曼尼 他最近踢丢了很多踢球得分
And Manny -- he's been missing a lot of kicks lately.

93
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:10,000
可能会害我们输掉比赛啊
He could cost us a game.

94
00:03:10,140 --> 00:03:11,220
我可能得把他换下场
I may have to bench him.

95
00:03:11,220 --> 00:03:13,260
教练总得做最有利于队伍的安排
A coach has to do what's best for the team.

96
00:03:13,260 --> 00:03:15,560
家族忠诚对你来说一点不重要吗
Does family loyalty mean nothing to you, Mitchell?

97
00:03:15,660 --> 00:03:18,520
更别说我还得面对愤怒的杰和歌洛莉亚
Not to mention I'd be facing the wrath of Jay and Gloria.

98
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:20,080
那你就让他上场
Well, then you should play him.

99
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:23,020
冒着牺牲我们3比0的完美战绩吗
And risk our perfect 3-0 record

100
00:03:23,020 --> 00:03:26,040
这可是我当橄榄球队教练的第一年
in my first year as the varsity football coach,

101
00:03:26,040 --> 00:03:27,360
本可以成为我进入大学工作
when this could be a stepping-stone

102
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:29,480
获得事业成功的垫脚石呢
to a college job or who knows what else?

103
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:31,140
灰姑娘一般的故事啊
You know, it's basically a cinderella story.

104
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,580
至少你服装是有了
Well, at least you have the outfit for it.

105
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:33,780
你到底还要不要帮我了
Are you gonna help me or not?

106
00:03:34,340 --> 00:03:36,160
不好意思 好吧
I'm sorry. Um...okay.

107
00:03:37,028 --> 00:03:37,832
也许你可以...
Well, maybe what you could do is --

108
00:03:37,832 --> 00:03:40,340
我可以...尽教练之责
You know what I could do... is coach.

109
00:03:40,340 --> 00:03:41,920
曼尼只是处于低潮期
You know, Manny's just in a slump.

110
00:03:42,220 --> 00:03:43,720
他缺乏自信
You know, he's lacking confidence.

111
00:03:44,020 --> 00:03:46,060
这并不容易 但我可以搞定这事
It's not gonna be easy, but I could pull this off.

112
00:03:46,300 --> 00:03:47,880
对于灰姑娘的戏服 你也是这样说的
That's what you said about the Cinderella costume,

113
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:49,660
两小时后我们就给汽车俱乐部打了电话
and two hours later, we were calling the auto club.

114
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,220
我们要去后院了
We're going in the backyard.

115
00:03:51,220 --> 00:03:52,520
去识别昆虫
To identify insects.

116
00:03:52,660 --> 00:03:54,100
我爱死了
Oh, I love that.

117
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,820
是我干的
I did that.

118
00:03:56,480 --> 00:03:59,720
希德妮·巴洛 跟我家莉莉一样有天赋
Sydney Barrow -- like my Lily, a gifted child,

119
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:03,100
多亏了我来做媒 她成了莉莉的新朋友
and, thanks to a little matchmaking, her new friend.

120
00:04:03,164 --> 00:04:05,560
帮一个天才儿童
Yeah, i-it can be challenging

121
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:08,120
找玩伴 是很有挑战性的
finding playmates for an exceptional child.

122
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,640
我无意吹嘘
I don't mean to brag,

123
00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:11,060
但那就是我儿时没有朋友的原因
but that's why I didn't have any friends.

124
00:04:11,284 --> 00:04:13,887
艾伦 我让克莱尔去见你
Yeah, Alan, I'm sending Claire to meet with you.

125
00:04:13,900 --> 00:04:15,060
我要去看我儿子的比赛
I got my kid's game.

126
00:04:15,660 --> 00:04:16,880
是啊 他是踢球的
Yeah, he's the kicker.

127
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:19,100
可能全靠他得分呢
Could all come down to him.

128
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:21,680
放松点
Yeah, take it easy.

129
00:04:22,020 --> 00:04:22,960
别那样说
Don't talk like that.

130
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:24,540
瞧 你让他好紧张
Look. You're stressing him out.

131
00:04:24,540 --> 00:04:25,360
你紧张吗
You're stressed out?

132
00:04:25,460 --> 00:04:25,900
有点
A little.

133
00:04:25,900 --> 00:04:28,500
很好 因为压力是橄榄球的一部分
Good! 'Cause stress is all part of football.

134
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:30,040
如果你没吐在嘴里
If you're not throwing up in your mouth,

135
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:31,100
那就不对
you're not doing it right.

136
00:04:31,100 --> 00:04:33,160
别理杰 宝贝
Ay. Don't pay attention to Jay, papi.

137
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:34,180
你会表现出色的
You're gonna be great.

138
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:36,300
你是我完美的小天使
You're my perfect little angel boy.

139
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:39,060
几个小时后比赛才开始
There's still a few hours left before game time.

140
00:04:39,460 --> 00:04:41,720
我想我还是去床底下躺会儿吧
I think I'll just go lie down under my bed for a little while.

141
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:44,280
看见你做的好事了吗
You see what you do to him?

142
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:46,480
他没事 紧张挺好的
He's fine. Nerves are good.

143
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:48,160
有次在季后赛前
Just before a playoff game one time,

144
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:49,500
我拔下了一整条眉毛
I pulled out a whole eyebrow.

145
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:53,820
克莱尔 怎么了
Hey, Claire. What's up?

146
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:55,680
我发烧了 你个带病的混蛋
My fever, you orange jackass.

147
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:56,400
好吧
Oh. Okay.

148
00:04:56,460 --> 00:04:58,060
显然你传染上了我的感冒
So, obviously, you have my cold now.

149
00:04:58,140 --> 00:05:00,000
大家的第一症状好像都是憎恨
Everybody's first symptom seems to be hate.

150
00:05:00,620 --> 00:05:02,600
多喝点水 在床上躺两天
Just pound the liquids, two days in bed.

151
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:03,340
你会没事的
You're gonna be fine.

152
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:04,980
我可没两天时间
I don't have two days.

153
00:05:05,020 --> 00:05:05,620
实际上
As a matter of fact,

154
00:05:05,620 --> 00:05:07,740
我现在就要去参加客户会议
I have to go to a client meeting right now.

155
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:08,160
为什么
Why?

156
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:10,520
因为我有工作 人们指望着我呢
Because I have a job and people are counting on me.

157
00:05:10,820 --> 00:05:13,120
不 是有人指望着你吧
Oh. No. Someone's counting on you.

158
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:15,380
这又是你和爸爸的事儿 你总是
This is about you and dad and how you just

159
00:05:15,380 --> 00:05:17,860
喜欢当他的强悍小超女
love being his toughy-tough little supergirl

160
00:05:17,860 --> 00:05:19,400
从来不请病假待在家
who never stays home sick,

161
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:20,560
手指断了
won a tennis tournament

162
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,400
都举不起来了
with a broken finger

163
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:22,620
还赢得了网球锦标赛冠军
that she couldn't even hold up.

164
00:05:22,860 --> 00:05:24,100
我现在就举着中指呢
I'm holding it up now.

165
00:05:24,620 --> 00:05:26,700
老爸的肯定是治不好你的
Daddy's approval is not the medicine that you need.

166
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:28,780
你何不直接给他打电话 告诉他
Why don't you just call him and tell him

167
00:05:28,780 --> 00:05:30,000
你没法去开会了
that you can't take the meeting,

168
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,300
超级无敌女汉子姐
old toughy-tough-super-tough?

169
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:33,060
你为什么跟我吵起来了
Why are you trying to turn this into a fight?

170
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:35,300
我打电话来是骂你害我生病的
I called to yell at you for getting me sick.

171
00:05:35,420 --> 00:05:36,440
爱你 拜拜
Love you. Bye.

172
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,640
我也爱你
I love you, too.

173
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:39,880
鸡 狗
Chicken, dog.

174
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,120
就差那么一点
Oh, so close.

175
00:05:41,420 --> 00:05:42,320
该我了
My turn.

176
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:44,260
鸡 鸡
Chicken, chicken.

177
00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:46,460
狗 狗
Dog, dog.

178
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:48,640
野山羊 野山羊
Ibex, ibex!

179
00:05:48,740 --> 00:05:50,460
瞧你玩得多好
Oh, look at you go!

180
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:51,960
太久以来
For far too long,

181
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,760
莉莉的朋友们都无法挑战她
Lily's friends just haven't challenged her.

182
00:05:53,760 --> 00:05:56,203
一直以来她的朋友都是吃胶水
It's been this endless procession of paste-eating,

183
00:05:56,203 --> 00:05:58,200
尿不进马桶 找不到鞋子的傻孩子
toilet-missing shoe-losers.

184
00:05:58,200 --> 00:05:59,360
但这俩人一起
But these two together --

185
00:05:59,860 --> 00:06:01,220
她们提高了对方的水平
they raise each other's game.

186
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:06,460
*我想知道你是什么*
*How I wonder what you are*

187
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:09,520
好棒 莉莉
So good, Lily.

188
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,880
我会弹 但我不太会唱
I can play, but I don't really sing.

189
00:06:11,880 --> 00:06:14,750
没关系 没有谁能擅长一切...
That's okay. Everybody can't be good at every--

190
00:06:18,340 --> 00:06:19,560
二爸 我的鞋子呢
Daddy, where's my shoe?

191
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:27,320
曼尼 深呼吸
Okay, Manny, take a deep breath.

192
00:06:27,460 --> 00:06:28,980
想象球垂直飞起来
Picture it going through the uprights.

193
00:06:29,900 --> 00:06:31,980
简单点 看着球 抬起肩膀
Keep it simple -- eyes on the ball, shoulders up,

194
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:33,540
看见你的脚踢到球 把球踢飞
see your foot hit it, drive through the ball.

195
00:06:33,660 --> 00:06:34,580
完成目标
Finish at your target!

196
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:38,040
这次更简单了
Even simpler this time --

197
00:06:38,060 --> 00:06:39,460
用你的脚踢球
kick the ball with your foot.

198
00:06:40,840 --> 00:06:42,500
上一次接触得不错
Great contact on that last one.

199
00:06:42,520 --> 00:06:43,480
这次对准球
This time, aim for the ball.

200
00:06:45,580 --> 00:06:47,340
这次认真点
Okay, this time, like you mean it.

201
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:48,900
我真的很抱歉
I'm really sorry.

202
00:06:49,580 --> 00:06:50,500
曼尼 听着
Okay, Manny, look...

203
00:06:51,320 --> 00:06:53,360
跟你说这话可不容易
There's no easy way to tell you this.

204
00:06:53,500 --> 00:06:54,380
好啊 曼尼
Hola, Manny!

205
00:06:54,380 --> 00:06:56,640
但我真的很喜欢
But, um... I, uh, really like the way

206
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:57,920
你的队服保持得这么干净
you're keeping your uniform clean.

207
00:06:58,060 --> 00:06:59,160
用颜色保鲜的漂白剂 教练
Color-safe bleach, coach.

208
00:06:59,220 --> 00:07:00,780
比赛时你会没事的
You'll be fine during the game.

209
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:03,300
拿出你去年暑假戒掉含糖饮料的势头来
Kick it like you kicked sugary drinks last summer.

210
00:07:03,300 --> 00:07:04,196
好
Okay.

211
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,600
我看见训练的情况了
So, I saw the practice.

212
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,020
不怎么好
Not very good.

213
00:07:08,020 --> 00:07:10,220
我很高兴你看到了 因为
I'm so glad you saw that, because --

214
00:07:10,220 --> 00:07:11,200
他是为了在赛前
He's getting all the bad kicks

215
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:13,140
把所有烂球都踢完了
out of the way before the game!

216
00:07:13,140 --> 00:07:15,601
他太棒了 好酷 曼尼
He's so good! Bravo, Manny!

217
00:07:15,611 --> 00:07:16,560
加油 教练
Go get 'em, coach.

218
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:17,240
你也是
You too.

219
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:25,760
不
Oh, no.

220
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,820
我已经染上了小卡的耳塞
I'd already had Cam's clogged ears,

221
00:07:27,940 --> 00:07:28,780
我爸的支气管炎
my dad's bronchitis,

222
00:07:28,820 --> 00:07:30,900
下一条症状来得太是时候了
and then there it was, right on schedule --

223
00:07:31,080 --> 00:07:32,020
歌洛莉亚的眩晕症
Gloria's vertigo.

224
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,520
我就是铁打的也不行了
Even I have my limits.

225
00:07:35,420 --> 00:07:36,460
打给爸爸
Call dad.

226
00:07:36,460 --> 00:07:39,900
保罗·路德是一位美国影视演员
Paul Rudd is an American film and television actor.

227
00:07:40,140 --> 00:07:40,560
闭嘴
Shut up.

228
00:07:41,860 --> 00:07:42,560
打给 爸爸
Call... dad!

229
00:07:43,440 --> 00:07:44,700
宝贝女儿 你怎么样了
Hey, honey. How you doing?

230
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:45,820
我到酒店了
I'm at the hotel,

231
00:07:45,820 --> 00:07:47,300
我真的很努力克服感冒的不适
and I'm really fighting this cold.

232
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:49,720
感冒这种小病难不倒你
Well, then, that cold doesn't stand a chance, huh?

233
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:51,320
我的小女超人是不可战胜的
Nothing stops my little supergirl.

234
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:52,840
是的
Yeah.

235
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:53,520
怎么了
What's up?

236
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:55,560
没什么 我只是
Nothing. I just...

237
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:58,040
我想告诉你这件事包在我身上
I wanted you to know that I'm on this, dad.

238
00:07:58,420 --> 00:07:59,800
我从来不怀疑这一点
I never doubted that, honey.

239
00:08:00,020 --> 00:08:00,400
是吗
Yeah.

240
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:02,340
休息厅在哪
Where's the lounge?

241
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:03,160
最后面
At the far end.

242
00:08:03,500 --> 00:08:03,980
好的
Perfect.

243
00:08:04,300 --> 00:08:05,560
我还记得你大一的时候
I remember your junior year,

244
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:07,140
你为了那场锦标赛可是拼了命一样
you played so tough through that tournament.

245
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:10,420
什么比赛来着 曲棍球吧
What was that? Uh.. .field hockey.

246
00:08:10,820 --> 00:08:11,300
橄榄球
Rugby.

247
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,700
对
Right, and, uh,

248
00:08:13,760 --> 00:08:14,860
你还把脚踝扭伤了
well, you sprained your ankle.

249
00:08:14,860 --> 00:08:16,240
差点就成了骨裂
Could have been a hairline fracture.

250
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:17,040
那就更棒了
That's even better.

251
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:19,180
可你一点事没有 继续紧跟着球跑
But it didn't stop you. You rolled right through it.

252
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:20,840
对
Yeah.

253
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:23,020
我那天感觉特别自豪
I was a pretty proud papa that day.

254
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:23,780
好的 够了
Okay, stop!

255
00:08:23,780 --> 00:08:25,630
好吧 我把她说害羞了
All right. I'm embarrassing her.

256
00:08:25,640 --> 00:08:26,940
今晚见 乖女儿
I'll see you tonight, honey.

257
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:28,100
再见
Bye.

258
00:08:37,017 --> 00:08:37,980
艾伦
Alan.

259
00:08:37,980 --> 00:08:39,100
-你好 克莱尔 -你好
- Hey, Claire. - Hey.

260
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,300
-好久不见 -就是啊
- It's been ages. - Yeah.

261
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:41,100
你应该饿了吧
I hope you're hungry.

262
00:08:41,300 --> 00:08:41,960
我在楼顶的
I got us a table

263
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,400
旋转餐厅订了张桌子
at the revolving rooftop restaurant.

264
00:08:44,113 --> 00:08:45,441
不
Oh, no.

265
00:08:46,540 --> 00:08:46,940
克莱尔
Claire?

266
00:08:47,900 --> 00:08:49,880
这里刚好是我对着蛋糕打喷嚏之前
Here I am right before the cake sneeze.

267
00:08:51,040 --> 00:08:52,760
看起来像在大笑 对吧
It looks like I'm cracking up, right?

268
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:54,360
从这里 我们用绿色背景拍摄一幕
So from here, we'll jump to a green-screen

269
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,660
你也在大笑的样子
shot of you laughing, too.

270
00:08:55,660 --> 00:08:56,900
然后把你剪切到
Then I'll take that and drop it into

271
00:08:56,900 --> 00:08:59,400
一大桌人的图像里面去
a pre-existing shot of a table full of people.

272
00:08:59,400 --> 00:08:59,800
超简单
Easy!

273
00:09:00,660 --> 00:09:02,220
笑起来吧
And we are laughing.

274
00:09:03,780 --> 00:09:04,180
再大一点
Bigger.

275
00:09:06,260 --> 00:09:08,140
想象我学尤达走进蜘蛛网的样子
Like when I do Yoda walking into a spider web.

276
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:10,700
就是这个
Nailed it!

277
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:12,480
如果大笑是最好的良药
If laughter's the best medicine,

278
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:14,449
那你就是葡萄味的抗过敏贴
then you're grape-flavored triaminic.

279
00:09:14,460 --> 00:09:17,140
接下来要拍摄我听杰演讲时的镜头
Okay, now I need some footage of me reacting to Jay's speech

280
00:09:17,140 --> 00:09:18,740
来替换朝香槟打喷嚏这一段
to replace the champagne sneeze,

281
00:09:18,740 --> 00:09:20,860
然后把这段接到另一张一大桌人的图像里
and I'll just drop that into another table full of people.

282
00:09:21,460 --> 00:09:22,780
对于杰的演讲 我应该有什么反应
How would I react to Jay's speech?

283
00:09:23,540 --> 00:09:24,580
表现出感动的样子
Give me "Touched."

284
00:09:26,540 --> 00:09:27,260
悲伤
Now sad.

285
00:09:28,660 --> 00:09:29,180
再悲伤点
Sadder.

286
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:31,320
加油 感情再深点
Come on. Dig deep.

287
00:09:31,740 --> 00:09:33,700
就想像我要去上大学了
Think about me going off to college.

288
00:09:34,880 --> 00:09:36,040
你怎么在笑
Why are you smiling?

289
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:38,947
我没想到你能考上
Uh, I-I didn't think you'd get in.

290
00:09:39,580 --> 00:09:41,420
我不想把一个大好的周六晚上
I don't want to waste a Saturday night

291
00:09:41,420 --> 00:09:42,380
浪费在看视频上
Watching some video.

292
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:44,540
我们待在家里租个电影看吧
Let's just stay home and rent a movie.

293
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,360
两件事 电影也是视频
Okay, two things -- a movie is a video,

294
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:48,220
还有你不想去外公家就是因为
and the only reason you don't want to go to grandpa's

295
00:09:48,220 --> 00:09:49,400
你害怕见到安迪
is because you're avoiding Andy.

296
00:09:49,620 --> 00:09:51,300
害怕 才不是呢
Avoid? I don't --

297
00:09:51,300 --> 00:09:52,162
我
I --

298
00:09:52,580 --> 00:09:54,100
我不想谈这个话题
I'm not having this conversation.

299
00:09:54,340 --> 00:09:56,700
拜托 你从婚礼那天开始就躲着他
Oh, please. You've been dodging him since the wedding.

300
00:09:56,740 --> 00:09:58,500
是你让我离他远一点的
You told me to stay away from him.

301
00:09:58,620 --> 00:10:00,060
我只是说除非你真的喜欢他
I just meant don't lead him on

302
00:10:00,060 --> 00:10:01,420
不然别招惹人家
unless you really like him.

303
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:03,200
对 你说得没错
Yes, and you were right,

304
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:05,720
所以为了保护他 我一直跟他保持距离
so I've been keeping my distance to protect him.

305
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:09,280
你这么想还是挺成熟的
Well, that's actually really mature of you.

306
00:10:09,500 --> 00:10:11,760
我长得这么辣 当然得更负责任一点
With great hotness comes great responsibility.

307
00:10:12,260 --> 00:10:13,200
恢复本性了
There she is.

308
00:10:17,940 --> 00:10:19,840
如果曼尼能踢好这球 我们就领先了
If Manny makes this one, we go ahead.

309
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:21,060
压力很大
Lot of pressure.

310
00:10:21,540 --> 00:10:23,440
我打赌他紧张得胃里泛酸
I'll bet he's chewing on his own stomach acid right now.

311
00:10:23,460 --> 00:10:25,660
有点太多愁善感了 我就是挺怀念的
Sorry to be so sentimental. I just miss it.

312
00:10:25,900 --> 00:10:28,120
曼尼 大力踢球
Manny, kick this one hard!

313
00:10:31,580 --> 00:10:32,960
不愧是我的孩子
That's my boy!

314
00:10:34,100 --> 00:10:35,620
实际上 是我们家孩子
Actually, that's our boy.

315
00:10:36,700 --> 00:10:37,720
那才是我们家孩子
Oh, that's our boy.

316
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:45,120
关键时刻
Moment of truth.

317
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:47,800
看到任何小问题 都请指出来
If you see even the tiniest problem, point it out.

318
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:51,200
我父亲死于25年前的今天
My dad died 25 years ago today.

319
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:55,980
这跟我想象的场景不太一样
That did not land quite the way I'd hoped.

320
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:58,180
小卡 米奇尔
Cam, Mitchell...

321
00:10:58,560 --> 00:11:01,100
愿你的第一次婚姻和我的第二次一样幸福
May your first marriage be as happy as my second.

322
00:11:01,340 --> 00:11:02,300
敬新郎们
To the grooms.

323
00:11:02,460 --> 00:11:03,500
等等 我收回
Wait a minute. I take that back.

324
00:11:03,540 --> 00:11:04,900
这太糟了
Oh, that's so bad.

325
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:05,640
敬我的儿子们
To my sons.

326
00:11:06,432 --> 00:11:07,787
杰
Oh. Jay.

327
00:11:14,577 --> 00:11:16,594
好吧 我有几点建议
O...kay. I have a few notes.

328
00:11:16,594 --> 00:11:17,440
我该怎么办
What am I gonna do?

329
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,820
我们还有一个小时就要放这个视频了
We have to show this thing in an hour!

330
00:11:18,820 --> 00:11:20,514
你知道换作是你会怎么跟我说吗
You know what you'd tell me?

331
00:11:20,580 --> 00:11:22,260
放原来的视频 勇于承担后果
Show the real video and take your lumps.

332
00:11:22,260 --> 00:11:22,920
我不想那样
I don't wanna.

333
00:11:22,920 --> 00:11:24,200
那是我会说的话
That's what I would say.

334
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,720
然后你会跟我说
And then you would tell me,

335
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:27,140
你也许不想那样做
"You might not want to do it,

336
00:11:27,140 --> 00:11:28,820
但你必须做正确的事
"but you have to do what's right.

337
00:11:28,820 --> 00:11:29,640
那会使你
"And that will make you

338
00:11:29,640 --> 00:11:32,280
从零号病患变为英雄病患
go from patient zero to patient hero."

339
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:33,700
该死 我说得太有道理了
Damn it, I've got a point.

340
00:11:34,740 --> 00:11:37,680
这么聪明一个人怎么会打那么多喷嚏呢
How does someone so smart sneeze on so many things?

341
00:11:38,860 --> 00:11:39,300
画完了
Finished!

342
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:40,720
来看看
Let's see.

343
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:43,820
不好意思 这是有人抢劫了画廊吗
Oh. I'm sorry, but did someone rob an art gallery?

344
00:11:43,820 --> 00:11:45,820
因为这简直太美
Because this is absolutely beau--

345
00:11:45,820 --> 00:11:46,180
画完了
Done!

346
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:48,320
好吧
Okay.

347
00:11:48,900 --> 00:11:50,500
我们应该在上面写上名字
We should probably put your names on those

348
00:11:50,500 --> 00:11:51,520
不然该分不出来谁是谁的了
so we can remember whose is whose.

349
00:11:52,260 --> 00:11:53,220
下一个活动
Next activity.

350
00:11:53,640 --> 00:11:55,080
莉莉知道所有的首府
Okay, Lily knows all the capitals.

351
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:55,620
爸爸
Dad!

352
00:11:55,620 --> 00:11:56,320
没关系的 宝贝
It's all right, honey.

353
00:11:56,620 --> 00:11:58,200
第一个是奥尔巴尼[纽约州首府]
The first is Albany.

354
00:11:58,560 --> 00:11:59,520
接下来是
Then there's...?

355
00:11:59,520 --> 00:12:03,380
我以为你说的是各国的首府
Ohh! I thought you meant world capitals.

356
00:12:03,380 --> 00:12:04,340
阿尔及利亚 阿尔及尔
Algeria, Algiers.

357
00:12:05,020 --> 00:12:05,160
安哥拉
Angola --

358
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:07,463
你还真是爱显摆自己有学问啊
Oh. Well, you're just a little know-it-all, aren't ya?

359
00:12:08,746 --> 00:12:10,878
天哪 非常抱歉
Oh, my god. I am so sorry. I -- oh.

360
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:13,520
好了 希德妮 忘记我说的话吧宝贝
Okay. Sydney, forget that I said that, okay, honey?

361
00:12:13,520 --> 00:12:16,440
不行 因为我记忆力超群
I can't! I have a photographic memory!

362
00:12:17,060 --> 00:12:18,840
你把我的朋友搞哭了
You made my friend cry!

363
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:19,840
不 我不是有意的
No, I didn't mean to --

364
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:20,300
天哪
Oh, boy.

365
00:12:20,354 --> 00:12:22,350
你是故意的
You did that on purpose!

366
00:12:22,350 --> 00:12:24,748
不 不 我不是
No, no. I-I don't think I did.

367
00:12:24,900 --> 00:12:26,220
天哪 你妈妈来了
Oh, gosh. And there's your mother.

368
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:27,980
希德妮 宝贝 不能再哭了 好吗
Sydney, sweetheart, we got to stop crying, okay?

369
00:12:27,980 --> 00:12:28,460
你没事
You're okay.

370
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:29,800
我的表卡住了
Oh. Now my watch is caught.

371
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:31,520
没事 轻轻拉 轻轻拉
All right, little pull. Little pull!

372
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:32,780
没事的 没事的
It's fine! It's fine!

373
00:12:32,780 --> 00:12:34,300
没事的 没事的
Oh, it's fine. It's fine.

374
00:12:35,269 --> 00:12:37,676
-我们玩得太开心了 -那就好
- We had so much fun. - Oh, good.

375
00:12:37,676 --> 00:12:39,660
希德妮 宝贝 你在哭吗
Sydney, honey, are you crying?

376
00:12:39,660 --> 00:12:42,720
他把我的画毁了 还拉我头发
He ruined my picture and pulled my hair!

377
00:12:42,900 --> 00:12:44,040
只是个小意外
Just little accidents.

378
00:12:44,050 --> 00:12:46,184
他还说我爱显摆学问
And he called me a know-it-all!

379
00:12:46,184 --> 00:12:49,323
什么样的人会这样说一个六岁的孩子
What kind of a person calls a 6-year-old a know-it-all?

380
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:53,360
她还比你小一岁是吗
She's a year younger than you?

381
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:57,740
我是不是不该来
Should I not have come?

382
00:12:57,740 --> 00:12:59,540
安迪会不会觉得很怪
Oh, is it gonna be weird for Andy?

383
00:12:59,540 --> 00:13:00,820
我不应该穿得这么好看的
I shouldn't have dressed so cute.

384
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:01,880
把毛衣换给我
Hey, switch sweaters with me.

385
00:13:01,980 --> 00:13:02,740
做你自己吧
Just be yourself.

386
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:04,700
这样他能最快速度忘掉你
It's the surest way for him to get over you.

387
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:06,160
好吧 谢谢
Okay, thanks.

388
00:13:07,504 --> 00:13:09,156
-小卡叔叔 -你好
- Hey, uncle Cam. - Hey.

389
00:13:09,180 --> 00:13:10,680
我的天 你来了太好了
Oh, my gosh. I'm so glad you're here.

390
00:13:10,860 --> 00:13:11,860
你得和莉莉谈谈
You got to talk to Lily.

391
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:13,280
她不和我讲话了 因为
She's not speaking to me because --

392
00:13:13,280 --> 00:13:13,460
我有更大的问题
I have bigger problems.

393
00:13:13,460 --> 00:13:15,160
我还没跟你说我的问题呢
I haven't even told you what mine is yet.

394
00:13:15,180 --> 00:13:16,060
我让曼尼坐冷板凳了
I benched Manny.

395
00:13:16,060 --> 00:13:18,200
我担心杰和歌洛莉亚会生我的气
I'm worried Jay and Gloria are mad at me.

396
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:19,540
-他们说什么了吗 -没有
- Have they said anything? - No.

397
00:13:19,540 --> 00:13:21,460
我只听到他们对我说了"你好"
All I've gotten from them so far is "Hola"

398
00:13:21,460 --> 00:13:22,820
还有"这瓶威士忌不分享"
and "That scotch is not for company."

399
00:13:24,900 --> 00:13:26,540
天哪 菲尔 那是婚礼视频吗
Oh, my gosh, Phil, is that the wedding video?

400
00:13:26,660 --> 00:13:28,400
我们太期待了
Oh, we are so excited to see it.

401
00:13:28,420 --> 00:13:30,320
我也很期待给你们看
I'm so excited to show you guys!

402
00:13:31,980 --> 00:13:33,580
快去客厅 把所有电线都剪了
Get in the media closet. Cut every wire.

403
00:13:33,580 --> 00:13:35,100
爸爸 冷静点
Dad, get ahold of yourself.

404
00:13:35,100 --> 00:13:35,480
你说得对
You're right.

405
00:13:36,140 --> 00:13:37,320
我说了"你说得对"
I said, "You're right"!

406
00:13:37,560 --> 00:13:39,080
对不起 我手臂已经准备到位了
Sorry. I already had it loaded up.

407
00:13:39,220 --> 00:13:40,380
大家都来吃晚饭吧
Everybody come to dinner.

408
00:13:40,420 --> 00:13:42,120
然后我们就看婚礼视频
Then we watch the wedding movie.

409
00:13:42,260 --> 00:13:43,780
谢谢你们的招待
Hey, thank you guys so much for hosting.

410
00:13:43,860 --> 00:13:45,640
我希望曼尼的事你们不会有什么想法
And I hope there's no hard feelings about Manny.

411
00:13:45,760 --> 00:13:47,580
你是教练 你不能徇私
You're the coach. You can't play favorites.

412
00:13:48,140 --> 00:13:48,500
正是
Exactly.

413
00:13:48,500 --> 00:13:50,860
听你这么说我就放心了
I am so relieved to hear you say that.

414
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:52,940
不 不 我们坏了一把椅子
No, no, no. One of our chairs is broken.

415
00:13:53,380 --> 00:13:55,580
来 我为你准备了特殊的位子
Come. I have a special seat for you.

416
00:13:57,800 --> 00:13:58,180
米奇尔
Mitchell!

417
00:13:59,180 --> 00:14:00,300
她让我坐冷板凳
She benched me.

418
00:14:03,660 --> 00:14:05,500
不 你又赢了我
No! You beat me again!

419
00:14:05,620 --> 00:14:07,000
那你真是太尴尬了
Well, this is embarrassing for you.

420
00:14:07,100 --> 00:14:08,260
你好 陌生人
Oh. Hey, stranger.

421
00:14:08,660 --> 00:14:09,440
我故意让他赢的
I let him win.

422
00:14:10,420 --> 00:14:11,160
你怎么样
How you been?

423
00:14:11,540 --> 00:14:13,200
很好 很好 就是有点忙
Oh, good, good. Just busy.

424
00:14:13,800 --> 00:14:15,680
我想应该打个招呼 毕竟时间挺长了
I figured I'd say hi. It's been a while.

425
00:14:15,860 --> 00:14:16,780
是啊
I know, right?

426
00:14:16,820 --> 00:14:19,140
我也一直在忙着照顾这个小家伙
I've been busy, too, between this little guy

427
00:14:19,140 --> 00:14:20,860
还要回去探望家人
and visiting my family back home.

428
00:14:24,934 --> 00:14:27,141
我 我真的很高兴你能过来
I'm -- I'm really glad you came by.

429
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:30,220
之前还担心我们之间会比较尴尬
I was afraid things got, like...weird

430
00:14:30,220 --> 00:14:31,740
鉴于上次碰面时候的事
last time we saw each other.

431
00:14:31,740 --> 00:14:33,740
是啊 那件事 我真的...
Y-yeah, about that -- um, I rea--

432
00:14:33,740 --> 00:14:35,400
我就知道
Oh! I knew it.

433
00:14:35,560 --> 00:14:37,560
有时候我就是个大蠢蛋
I am such a goober sometimes.

434
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:40,500
贝丝让我手足无措
I was just confused about Beth,

435
00:14:40,500 --> 00:14:42,980
我以为你在向我传达某种信号
and I thought you were sending me some signals,

436
00:14:43,460 --> 00:14:45,160
这样想真是太傻了
which is so stupid.

437
00:14:45,660 --> 00:14:48,120
希望我的举动没有吓到你
I hope I didn't, like, creep you out or something.

438
00:14:48,260 --> 00:14:49,540
你不该这样想自己
You shouldn't feel stupid.

439
00:14:50,100 --> 00:14:52,780
你当时很脆弱 而我在婚礼上
You know, you were vulnerable, I was at a wedding,

440
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,140
所有人都是基佬
everybody was super-gay,

441
00:14:54,340 --> 00:14:56,000
根本没有人看我一眼
and nobody was looking at me.

442
00:14:56,360 --> 00:14:58,760
也许我确实向你传达了某种信号
I probably did send you a signal.

443
00:14:59,640 --> 00:15:01,140
对你造成的困惑我表示歉意
I'm sorry if I gave you the wrong idea.

444
00:15:01,940 --> 00:15:03,340
不用介意
Don't worry about it.

445
00:15:03,520 --> 00:15:05,220
很高兴我们没做出更进一步的举动
I'm just glad we didn't take it any further.

446
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:08,120
很明显 我们两个实在不配
Because clearly, we are wrong for each other.

447
00:15:08,300 --> 00:15:10,720
完全同意 我们还是做朋友比较好
Totally. We are way better as friends.

448
00:15:10,940 --> 00:15:11,300
没错
Way!

449
00:15:11,980 --> 00:15:13,600
难以想象我们亲吻会怎么样
Like, imagine if we kissed or something.

450
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:15,720
那一定会是场灾难
Ha! That would've been a disaster.

451
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:17,040
一场大灾难
A huge disaster.

452
00:15:17,040 --> 00:15:18,642
你会被摧毁的
You would've been destroyed.

453
00:15:18,642 --> 00:15:20,279
是啊 什么
Yeah -- what?

454
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:22,720
乔 你头发怎么都白了
Whoa, Joe. What's with the snow on the roof?

455
00:15:22,740 --> 00:15:23,940
你看起来老得像个总统
You're aging like a president.

456
00:15:26,019 --> 00:15:27,500
克莱尔发信息让我们先吃
Claire texted to start.

457
00:15:27,500 --> 00:15:28,700
她会晚些过来
She's going to be a little late.

458
00:15:28,820 --> 00:15:29,420
真抓狂
Well, that's crazy.

459
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:30,200
我们应该等她一起
We should wait for her

460
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:31,600
不如改天再看婚礼录像吧
and watch the wedding video some other time.

461
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:32,800
不用 我们开吃吧
No, no, no. Let's eat.

462
00:15:33,040 --> 00:15:34,040
我不怎么饿
I'm not very hungry.

463
00:15:34,160 --> 00:15:36,040
我嘴里依然残留着失败的味道
I still have the taste of failure in my mouth.

464
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:37,880
坐下 这是家庭聚餐
Sit down. This is a family dinner.

465
00:15:37,880 --> 00:15:38,860
我们要一起吃
We all eat together.

466
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:41,100
你们那有土豆吗 我闻到土豆的味道了
Are there potatoes? I smell potatoes.

467
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:42,200
给你的 宝贝儿
Here you go, sweetheart.

468
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:43,440
我不吃
You eat it.

469
00:15:43,760 --> 00:15:44,940
莉莉 没那么糟
Lily, it wasn't that bad.

470
00:15:45,060 --> 00:15:47,020
你手表上还夹着我朋友的头发呢
You still got my friend's hair in your watch!

471
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:49,120
她会回来的
She's coming back.

472
00:15:49,281 --> 00:15:51,265
你脑子进水了吗
What were you thinking with that playdate?

473
00:15:51,280 --> 00:15:52,420
我是出于对孩子的保护
I was feeling protective.

474
00:15:52,520 --> 00:15:54,180
那孩子让莉莉很难堪
That girl made Lily feel bad.

475
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,440
也许是让你很难堪吧
Or did she make you feel bad?

476
00:15:55,520 --> 00:15:56,300
我的确不喜欢
I didn't love it.

477
00:15:56,580 --> 00:15:58,040
新手父母通常都会这样的
That happens with all first-time parents.

478
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:59,860
总认为自己的孩子是最聪明的
We think our kids are the best or the smartest.

479
00:15:59,860 --> 00:16:01,780
曾经很长时间 我们也那样看待海莉
For the longest time, that's how we felt about Haley.

480
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:03,700
"很长时间" 真的吗
"The longest time"? Really?

481
00:16:03,940 --> 00:16:04,920
你不能迫使孩子
You can't force your kids

482
00:16:04,920 --> 00:16:06,200
一直活在你不切实际的期待当中
to live up to your unreal expectations.

483
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:08,740
他们并不完美 但你依然爱他们
They're not perfect, but you love them anyway.

484
00:16:08,760 --> 00:16:10,500
对大人一样适用 也许更应该如此
Also applies to adults -- probably more so.

485
00:16:10,500 --> 00:16:12,420
我就是这样的 是不是
That is what I'm doing, isn't it?

486
00:16:12,483 --> 00:16:15,380
杰在曼尼踢球这件事上一贯如此
Jay does it all the time with Manny's football.

487
00:16:15,380 --> 00:16:18,320
你们看他 因为担心让杰失望
Look at him -- he's so upset of disappointing him

488
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:19,320
今天连饭都不想吃了
that he won't eat today.

489
00:16:19,380 --> 00:16:20,880
我们不要跑题好不好
Let's keep in mind what's important here --

490
00:16:21,060 --> 00:16:21,980
我们在生小卡的气
We're mad at Cam.

491
00:16:22,060 --> 00:16:23,840
你一向如此
You have always been like this.

492
00:16:23,940 --> 00:16:26,200
你给儿女们太大压力
You put so much pressure into your kids

493
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:27,900
最后导致他们崩溃
that they fall into pieces.

494
00:16:27,900 --> 00:16:30,040
我从没给过他们无法承受的压力
I never put more pressure on my kids than they can handle.

495
00:16:32,660 --> 00:16:34,380
别生气 爸
Oh, don't be mad, dad.

496
00:16:34,580 --> 00:16:37,000
对不起 我尽力了 真的尽力了
I'm sorry. I tried. I really -- I tried.

497
00:16:41,140 --> 00:16:42,420
咚咚咚 又是我
Knock, knock. Me again.

498
00:16:42,580 --> 00:16:43,300
好啊
Hey, you.

499
00:16:43,580 --> 00:16:45,720
让我快速跟进一下
Hey. So, uh, quick follow-up.

500
00:16:46,060 --> 00:16:49,440
你刚才说如果我们亲吻我会被摧毁
Um, when you said I would be destroyed if we had kissed,

501
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:51,000
那到底是什么意思
what exactly did you mean by that?

502
00:16:51,280 --> 00:16:52,100
天哪
Oh, gosh.

503
00:16:52,240 --> 00:16:53,880
让你很困惑是吧
I guess that is confusing, huh?

504
00:16:53,880 --> 00:16:54,320
是的
Yeah.

505
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:56,760
我的意思是你会被我迷得神魂颠倒
I just meant that you would've been emotionally ruined.

506
00:16:56,760 --> 00:16:57,180
什么
What?!

507
00:16:57,340 --> 00:16:59,180
是的 我也不明白自己怎么会这样
Yeah. I don't understand it myself,

508
00:16:59,180 --> 00:17:02,240
但我就是有这种魅力
but there's a lot of heat coming off of this.

509
00:17:02,680 --> 00:17:04,880
女孩都无法抗拒我这样的男孩
Girls do not get over this guy.

510
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:07,420
不敢说自己是毒品 不过
I'm not calling myself a drug, but --

511
00:17:07,420 --> 00:17:10,200
不好意思 贝丝不是甩了你十几次吗
I'm sorry. Hasn't Beth broken up with you, like, 10 times?

512
00:17:10,340 --> 00:17:11,920
可她依然迫切地想跟我复合
She's dying to get back with me, though.

513
00:17:12,068 --> 00:17:13,564
可能就跟戒毒的感觉差不多
I wouldn't say it's withdrawal, but --

514
00:17:13,580 --> 00:17:16,320
告诉你吧 我才是让男孩念念不忘的
For the record, guys don't get over me, okay?

515
00:17:16,560 --> 00:17:18,500
最新数据 我有三个追求者
At last count, I have three stalkers.

516
00:17:18,840 --> 00:17:21,560
其中一个甚至把我的样子喷刷在他的车上
One of them has my face spray-painted on his van.

517
00:17:21,620 --> 00:17:23,640
他画的时候我就得一直杵在那
I had to stand there forever while he did it!

518
00:17:24,180 --> 00:17:24,620
好吧
Okay.

519
00:17:26,560 --> 00:17:28,880
我的意思并不是如果我们亲吻
I didn't mean to imply that if we kissed,

520
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:29,940
我就不会迷上你
it wouldn't affect me.

521
00:17:30,820 --> 00:17:31,840
你开什么玩笑
Are you kidding?

522
00:17:32,460 --> 00:17:35,700
你那么漂亮 我根本配不上你
You are so pretty and so out of my league.

523
00:17:35,765 --> 00:17:39,100
那会颠覆我的整个世界
It would've... rocked my world.

524
00:17:39,100 --> 00:17:39,980
那好吧
Okay, then.

525
00:17:39,980 --> 00:17:42,560
只是会更让你疯狂 就是这样
It just would've hit you harder. That's all.

526
00:17:42,560 --> 00:17:45,160
普里契特先生 你该洗澡了
Mr. Pritchett! Your bath awaits!

527
00:17:45,840 --> 00:17:49,260
今天要搓搓小屁股 准备好了吗
Are you prepared for a bum-scrubbing today, sir?

528
00:17:50,838 --> 00:17:52,378
哦不
Ohhh, no.

529
00:17:52,400 --> 00:17:54,120
我说错话了 是不是
I said something wrong, didn't I?

530
00:17:55,100 --> 00:17:55,740
没有
No.

531
00:17:56,220 --> 00:17:57,900
不 是我在犯傻
No, I'm just being stupid.

532
00:17:59,180 --> 00:18:02,180
重点是 我们的关系未受影响 对吧
The point is is that, you know, we're good, right?

533
00:18:02,500 --> 00:18:03,240
那当然了
You betcha.

534
00:18:04,220 --> 00:18:06,120
来吧 别这么一本正经的
Aw, come on. Don't be so formal.

535
00:18:06,260 --> 00:18:07,180
来吧 小子
Come here, you.

536
00:18:13,700 --> 00:18:16,900
我答应要带这个小家伙去洗泡泡浴的
I promised this little dude a bubble beard.

537
00:18:16,900 --> 00:18:17,820
来抱抱
Come here.

538
00:18:18,420 --> 00:18:19,840
别就此成了陌生人 好吗
Don't be a stranger, okay?

539
00:18:23,680 --> 00:18:25,840
亲爱的 稍微自私一点吧
Honey, be a little selfish here.

540
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:28,280
你现在的健康状况完全看不了这视频啊
You are not up for watching this video.

541
00:18:28,500 --> 00:18:30,080
你都这样了为什么还要出门啊
Why were you even out of the house like this?

542
00:18:30,140 --> 00:18:32,480
因为我是个强悍的女汉子
Because I'm your toughy-tough supergirl.

543
00:18:32,480 --> 00:18:34,400
是没错 但也没必要因此拿...
Yes, you are, but that's no reason to risk you--

544
00:18:34,580 --> 00:18:35,920
离食物远一点
Away from the food!

545
00:18:36,040 --> 00:18:37,520
我们能下次再举行吗
Can we catch this again?

546
00:18:37,820 --> 00:18:39,360
你就是经常做这种事
This is exactly what you do!

547
00:18:39,420 --> 00:18:40,320
对他的亲生女儿也如此
To his own daughter.

548
00:18:40,320 --> 00:18:42,340
所以你们要正确看待我让曼尼坐冷板凳这事
Kind of puts me benching Manny in perspective.

549
00:18:42,340 --> 00:18:44,492
对了 你们那边有酱汁吗...
Also, is there a sauce going around or...

550
00:18:44,492 --> 00:18:47,040
小卡 你让我坐冷板凳是对的
Cam, you were right to bench me.

551
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:48,220
我踢得太烂了
I stunk out there.

552
00:18:48,560 --> 00:18:49,000
沉冤洗清了
Vindicated!

553
00:18:49,240 --> 00:18:50,220
但那不是因为杰
But not because of Jay.

554
00:18:50,460 --> 00:18:51,420
是因为你 妈
It's you, mom.

555
00:18:52,020 --> 00:18:52,460
什么
What?!

556
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:53,520
现场火药味儿太浓
Tensions are running high.

557
00:18:53,520 --> 00:18:54,380
我觉得我们都该回家避难
I think we should all go home.

558
00:18:54,480 --> 00:18:56,200
我从来不会担心让杰失望
I've never worried about disappointing Jay.

559
00:18:56,420 --> 00:18:57,800
他知道我体育很差劲
He knows I'm terrible at sports.

560
00:18:57,800 --> 00:18:58,880
我第一天就说了
Said it from day 1.

561
00:18:58,880 --> 00:19:01,440
这孩子身上唯一协调的部分就是他的衣服
Only thing coordinated about this kid was his outfits.

562
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:04,540
你老叫我完美的小天使什么的
The way you call me your perfect little angel boy and stuff,

563
00:19:04,960 --> 00:19:06,440
我总觉得我会让你失望
I just feel like I'm letting you down.

564
00:19:06,928 --> 00:19:09,437
曼尼 我真的很抱歉
Ay, Manny, I'm so sorry.

565
00:19:09,460 --> 00:19:10,720
你永远不会让我失望的
You could never let me down,

566
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:12,320
因为你是我的完美...
because you're my per--

567
00:19:13,020 --> 00:19:13,740
你挺好的
You're okay.

568
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:15,636
我把婚礼视频插进播放机了
I cued up the wedding video.

569
00:19:15,636 --> 00:19:16,920
是你独立完成的吗
All by yourself?

570
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:17,960
我们一起去看吧 你们觉得怎么样
Let's watch it. What do you say?

571
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:19,460
-好啊 -我们走
- Okay. - Let's go.

572
00:19:19,460 --> 00:19:20,060
我好紧张
I'm nervous.

573
00:19:20,060 --> 00:19:21,947
-现在这种时候合适吗 -当然
- Is this- is this a good time? - Yes.

574
00:19:21,947 --> 00:19:24,094
感觉...那好吧
It feels like -- o-okay.

575
00:19:24,254 --> 00:19:25,152
我们现在就去看吧 快点
Let's go now. Come on.

576
00:19:25,152 --> 00:19:26,600
我先坦白交代
F-full disclosure --

577
00:19:26,600 --> 00:19:28,640
视频中的大家可能看上去并不是太好
Everybody may not look their best in this video.

578
00:19:28,680 --> 00:19:29,500
好得很
It's good.

579
00:19:29,500 --> 00:19:33,140
我们就该看清真实的自我
It's about time we all start seeing ourselves as who we really are,

580
00:19:33,140 --> 00:19:34,840
而不是我们努力想成为的那种人
not who we're trying to be

581
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:37,099
-或别人期待我们成为的那种人 -对
- or who other people want us to be. - Right.

582
00:19:37,099 --> 00:19:38,780
我想说下 那是台非常复杂的机器
See, now, that is a very complicated machine.

583
00:19:38,780 --> 00:19:39,480
她是个小天才
She is a genius.

584
00:19:39,620 --> 00:19:40,400
你这头开的就不对
Not a good start.

585
00:19:40,860 --> 00:19:41,460
放吧 莉莉
Hit it, Lily.

586
00:19:42,220 --> 00:19:43,440
这会对你有好处的
This is gonna be good for you.

587
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:44,840
我这会儿可不喜欢你
I don't like you right now.

588
00:19:45,520 --> 00:19:46,140
天啊
Oh, god.

589
00:19:46,893 --> 00:19:48,620
那是 那是我在跳舞吗
Is that -is that my dancing?

590
00:19:48,620 --> 00:19:49,720
我竟然是那个样子的吗
Is that what I look like?

591
00:19:50,120 --> 00:19:51,980
别 好吧 那可真搞笑啊
No, no. Okay, that's really funny.

592
00:19:53,200 --> 00:19:54,460
快进 快点
Fast forward. Come on.

593
00:19:56,073 --> 00:19:58,189
那真的好甜蜜 小卡
That's actually really sweet, Cam.

594
00:19:58,440 --> 00:19:59,960
那是我的哭泣脸吗
Is that my crying face?

595
00:20:00,540 --> 00:20:03,040
真的好丑啊 怎么从来没人告诉过我啊
Oh, it's hideous! Why hasn't anyone told me?!

596
00:20:03,040 --> 00:20:04,440
天啊 我现在又是这副表情了 对吧
Oh, god, I'm doing it right now, aren't I?

597
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:05,080
把遥控器给我
Give me that.

598
00:20:06,330 --> 00:20:09,084
恭喜啊 米奇和小卡
Congratulations, Mitch and Cam!

599
00:20:10,620 --> 00:20:12,000
瞧瞧我穿那条裙子的样子
Look at me in that dress!

600
00:20:12,320 --> 00:20:13,600
我看上去美翻了
I look gorgeous!

601
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:14,860
我要倒回去再看一遍
Give me rewind!

602
00:20:14,860 --> 00:20:17,298
妈 瞧瞧你倚靠着那个吧台的样子
Mom, look at you holding on to that bar.

603
00:20:17,298 --> 00:20:18,760
你那时候也患了眩晕症呢
You had vertigo there, too.

604
00:20:18,760 --> 00:20:19,740
是啊 没错
Yeah, I sure did.

605
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:21,100
我们没必要老看这一段的
You know, we don't have to linger on that.

606
00:20:21,460 --> 00:20:22,300
哎呀妈
Oh, mom!

607
00:20:23,060 --> 00:20:25,180
大家好 我有几句话想说
Hey, everybody. I want to say something.

608
00:20:25,588 --> 00:20:28,540
一身汗 搞毛啊
All that sweat. What the hell?!

609
00:20:28,540 --> 00:20:30,800
我看上去像是刚跟鲸鱼紧密搂抱过
I look like I had shamu in a headlock!

610
00:20:30,800 --> 00:20:31,920
我觉得我要吐了
I think I'm gonna throw up.

611
00:20:31,920 --> 00:20:33,960
是啊 我也是 我太令人恶心了
Yeah, you and me both. I'm disgusting!

612
00:20:34,100 --> 00:20:36,280
不不不 是海莉的恶心病 天啊
No, no, no, no, no. It's Haley's nausea. Oh, god!

613
00:20:36,292 --> 00:20:37,260
我就长话短说吧
I'm gonna keep it short.

614
00:20:37,260 --> 00:20:37,780
是啊 务必这样
Yeah, you will.

615
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:39,880
那个屋子里有120位宾客
120 people in that room,

616
00:20:39,880 --> 00:20:41,700
却没人提醒我要把胳膊放下来
and no one told me to put my arm down!

617
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:43,320
我有个好主意
I have an idea, actually.

618
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:44,540
不如让我重新剪辑这个视频
Why don't I re-edit the video

619
00:20:44,540 --> 00:20:45,760
把那些尴尬的部分都剪掉吧
And cut out the embarrassing parts?

620
00:20:45,780 --> 00:20:46,540
那麻烦吗
Is that a problem?

621
00:20:46,620 --> 00:20:47,300
一点都不麻烦
Not at all!

622
00:20:47,300 --> 00:20:47,900
-那太好了 -轻松搞定
- That's great! - Done!

623
00:20:47,900 --> 00:20:49,040
太谢谢你了
Thank you so much.

624
00:20:51,920 --> 00:20:53,840
我知道你对着蛋糕打喷嚏了
I know you sneezed on the cake.

625
00:20:54,844 --> 00:20:57,332
没人喜欢无所不知的小孩
No one likes a know-it-all!

626
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:05,580
米奇尔
Mitchell.

627
00:21:06,060 --> 00:21:07,300
快上床来啊
Come to bed.

628
00:21:07,300 --> 00:21:09,024
你不打算睡觉了吗
Aren't you ever gonna sleep?

629
00:21:09,024 --> 00:21:11,786
不 我觉得我睡不着了
No. No, I don't think I'am.

630
00:21:27,180 --> 00:21:28,580
米奇尔
Mitchell.
